    <string name="settings_help_title">How do I get an EDSM API key?</string>
    <string name="settings_help_steps">1. Register a free account at edsm.net and log in.\n2. Create your commander there with your exact in-game name (platform: PC).\n3. In your profile, generate an API key and copy it.\n4. Install EDDiscovery, enter the same commander name + key, and send your history to EDSM.\n5. Enter that commander name + key here — done.</string>
